<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>CareConnect - Credentials Not Verified</title>
  <style>
      body {
          font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
          background-color: #fef2f2; /* light red background */
          color: #1F2937;
          padding: 20px;
      }
      .container {
          background-color: white;
          padding: 30px;
          border-radius: 10px;
          max-width: 600px;
          margin: auto;
          box-shadow: 0px 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
          border-left: 5px solid #ef4444; /* red accent */
      }
      h2 {
          color: #ef4444; /* red title */
      }
      p {
          font-size: 16px;
          line-height: 1.5;
      }
      .footer {
          margin-top: 20px;
          font-size: 12px;
          color: #888;
      }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
  <h2>Attention, <%= @doctor.full_name %>!</h2>
  <p>We reviewed your submitted credentials and <strong>they could not be verified</strong>. This means your account is not yet approved to log in.</p>
  <p>Please ensure that your full name and email are correct, and that you have uploaded a valid document for verification. Once updated, you can request verification again.</p>
  <p>If you believe this is an error, please contact our support team for assistance.</p>
  <div class="footer">
    &copy; <%= Time.current.year %> CareConnect. All rights reserved.
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>